# Solitary Sanctuary's second ability sees only creatures its controller taps (ruling 2023-09-01, the Tangle Wire example):
# Bot1's Raiding Party has each player tap white creatures they control, and Bot2 taps its own Savannah Lions (CR 701.26a). That
# is Bot2's tap, not Bot1's, so the Sanctuary does not trigger and Devoted Hero gets no +1/+1 counter.
